# A token never declared by RiDeclare or an inline declaration.
# GMANDictionary::getTokenId throws RIE_BADTOKEN; the parser must fall back
# to the float path rather than let that abort the request --
# GMANParameterList already treats an unresolvable token as "skip this
# parameter." Baseline behaviour recorded against the pre-fix binary: exits
# 0, no diagnostic.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Surface "plastic" "nosuchtoken" [4]
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
WorldEnd
